<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-04-16T16:17:04.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 14639,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "offer_browser_tts": "true",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "Every website you've ever visited started as an idea in someone's head.\nBefore the code. Before the colors. Before the first click.\nIt started with a vision.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/a6ec4e20446c3533a814af15c996a8f4-level1panel1.png",
        "key": "intro-web-lab3-1-panel-1",
        "layout": "text-top-left",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Being a web designer means being someone with a vision. It's about knowing what you want to build - and then figuring out how to turn that idea into something real.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/ef2e67875289fa3ac4d3071bac30f9a8-image-1775500568464.png",
        "key": "intro-web-lab3-1-panel-2",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "In this lesson, your collaborator is an AI. You'll describe your vision. It'll make a first attempt. And then the real work begins: your job is to look at the result and decide \"is this what I wanted?\"",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/a4c6e3916083cf9e68d07401b846102f-level1panel3.png",
        "key": "intro-web-lab3-1-panel-3",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "You'll learn about code as you go - but that's not where you start. You start with a vision. Something you want to make, for someone who might need it. Just like every designer does.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/296f45ede7f2cf3a4fe9420626f5b2a7-level1panel4.png",
        "key": "intro-web-lab3-1-panel-4",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "Take a minute to think of your vision and what you want to create. Ready? Let's build something.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/b1f8332cd8a3bf3a078eec9b52e15f45-level1panel5.png",
        "key": "intro-web-lab3-1-panel-5",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "published": true,
